  "description": "The proposal consists of the erection of a single-storey outbuilding located to the rear of the existing garage on the site.\nThe proposed structure will have approximate dimensions of 6 metres in length and 3 metres in width, with a flat roof and a maximum height of approximately 2.5 metres.\nThe building will be constructed using materials similar to the existing garage and will be used for storage and hobby workshop purposes associated with the existing garage.\nNo new vehicular or pedestrian access is proposed and the existing access arrangements will remain unchanged. No new streets or road layouts are proposed.\nSurface water from the roof will drain to permeable ground within the site.\nThe proposed outbuilding will be positioned directly behind the existing garage as indicated on the submitted block plan and proposed drawings.\n",
